      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         CHURCH LANE                                              north west side 5/310                                        No.17 Cadel House 1/1/69                                              II House. C17 refaced in red and blue brick C18. Old tiled roof, hipped to LH, large central chimney stack with moulded oversailing courses at top, mostly of thin bricks. 2-storeys 2 bays of 3-light casements, segmental arches to ground floor, central gabled porch, rising against recessed panel on 1st floor, with dentil brick verge, small window in gable, modern half-glazed door. LH flank elevation has 2 bays of 3-light casements. Listing NGR: SP8568210437"
    }
  ],
